	<section_number>60.2-109</section_number>
	<catch_line>Bond of Commissioner</catch_line>
	<text>
		The Commissioner shall be bonded in accordance with § 2.2-1840, conditioned upon the faithful discharge of his duties.
	</text>
	<history>Code 1950, § 60-27; 1968, c. 738, § 60.1-32; 1986, c. 480; 2021, Sp. Sess. I, c. 152.</history>
